  "content": "<div><div><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/77a85ba0-86c0-41ee-b06d-4cc265a4a2a0\" width=\"2048\" height=\"918\" alt=\"GeckoLib\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pPEqBgJtZW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/730912704776110121?color=green&amp;label=Discord&amp;logo=Discord&amp;logoColor=green&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"285\" height=\"40\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgeckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://shields.io/badge/kofi-Buy_a_coffee-ff5f5f?logo=ko-fi&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;color=green&amp;logoColor=green\" width=\"264\" height=\"39\"></a></strong><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>GeckoLib 是一個專為 Minecraft Mod 設計的動畫與渲染引擎，支援複雜的 3D 關鍵幀動畫、超過 30 種緩動效果、並行動畫支援、聲音與粒子關鍵幀、事件關鍵幀等功能。適用於 Forge、Fabric 和 NeoForge。<br></strong></span></h3></div><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:36px\"><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cc9c7ee8-ddcc-4826-9836-801a8b69045b\" alt=\"安裝\" width=\"2048\" height=\"246\"></strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">你可以查看 <strong>模組開發者</strong> 的安裝說明 </span><a href=\"https://github.com/bernie-g/geckolib/wiki/Installation-(Geckolib4)\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">這裡</span>。</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">對<strong>非模組開發者</strong>來說，只需下載模組並像往常一樣放入 mods 資料夾即可。</span></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:36px\"><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f43b07d1-c652-4371-9755-578ab04e1b39\" alt=\"文件\" width=\"2048\" height=\"246\"></strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">GeckoLib 提供了詳細的文件，以 </span><a href=\"https://github.com/bernie-g/geckolib/wiki/Home\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">維基</span></a><span style=\"font-size:24px\"> 的形式呈現。我們花了很多時間撰寫維基，請務必閱讀！</span></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:36px\"><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f61e887e-12fb-4264-a120-e782b48f0508\" alt=\"支援\" width=\"2048\" height=\"246\"></strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">如果你有任何問題，或需要協助開始使用，歡迎加入我們的 Discord！</span></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:36px\"><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bcf11ebf-c7d2-41f8-981a-8df6d7b9158e\" alt=\"貢獻\" width=\"2048\" height=\"246\"></strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">歡迎提交 <a href=\"https://github.com/bernie-g/geckolib/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pull requests</a>。若為重大變更，請先開啟 issue 討論您想進行的修改。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"></span></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:36px\"><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c01efae5-9cda-4f68-82f5-f0c99f3ff84a\" alt=\"授權\" width=\"2048\" height=\"246\"></strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimg.shields.io%252fbadge%252flicense-MIT-green\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/bernie-g/geckolib?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"287\" height=\"125\"></a></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>由 BisectHosting 贊助</strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">需要和朋友一起玩伺服器嗎？不知道如何架設？只需向 BisectHosting 租用一台已設定好的伺服器即可！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fgecko\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a97896c2-c19a-4143-acb2-e7de6e4a47c2\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting\" width=\"512\" height=\"273\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;點擊上方圖片，選擇方案（至少 4GB），使用我的代碼 <strong>gecko</strong> 即可在首月享受 <strong>25%</strong> 折扣，快和朋友一起玩吧！</span></p></div><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">標題圖片由 JoLee 製作</span></p>",
